# Installation Instructions

## Requirements
This project, to be run in parallel mode, requires the following Python packages:
-joblib (parallel processing)
-tqdm (progress bar)
-tqdm-joblib (integration between tqdm and joblib)
---

## Installation (pip)
Install all dependencies with:
pip install joblib tqdm tqdm-joblib
---

## Installation (conda)
If you are using conda:
conda install joblib tqdm
pip install tqdm-joblib
---

## Verify Installation
Run the following in Python:
from joblib import Parallel, delayed
from tqdm import tqdm
from tqdm_joblib import tqdm_joblib

If no errors occur, the installation is successful.
---

## Notes
Only `tqdm-joblib` is usually missing.

